  "remarks": "Liberal Democratic Party of Russia is a Russian political party. It supported Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine and backed the illegal and unrecognised annexation of Ukraine’s Donetsk, Luhansk, Zaporizhzhia and Kherson regions by Russia. It has also established numerous regional branches in occupied territories of Ukraine.",
